Z||000000||Spyder||03-05-2000||04:45 PM||||Here is a pic of my new VehiCross that I bought Saturday.<BR>I am so proud.  I had driven the same blazer for 9 years.<BR>It has 215 horse power, and does 0-60 in 8 seconds.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Vehicross.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Spyder (edited 03-06-2000).]||||reg||1
