Z||000002||fierospeeder||03-05-2000||07:48 PM||||I think we got a problem, looks like a SUV.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||fiero56||03-05-2000||08:32 PM||||It IS an SUV! I knew it would happen. I'll bet that gets a lot of looks(I love the wheels!!!). Haven't seen any around town yet, but did see 4 Honda S2000s driving around this weekend, among other things.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||03-05-2000||08:51 PM||||Do you know how many Fieros you could have bought for $23000??!!!!!||||reg||1
